tab cpu | CPU | memory

sub power | Power plan & boost

tweak cpu.plan | bolt | rec
  name  Power plan
  desc  Creates the tuned cr1mix app plan from Ultimate Performance and makes it active: no core parking, no idle demotion, aggressive boost, no PCIe, USB, disk or Wi-Fi power saving and no sleep timers. The laptop profile keeps battery savings when unplugged. Balanced goes back to the stock Windows plan.
  opt   desktop | Desktop
  PLAN  c5e11f6a-7d94-4a7c-bdd0-f31d5aa6b2c4 | cr1mix app (desktop)
  USE   _common
  PW    proc 893dee8e-2bef-41e0-89c6-b55d0929964c - 100
  PW    proc 893dee8e-2bef-41e0-89c6-b55d0929964d - 100
  PW    proc 36687f9e-e3a5-4dbf-b1dc-15eb381c6863 - 0
